SWISS MODEL:
----> Homology modeling webserver ,which predicts the 3D structure of protein (AA seq) - Based on tmeplate.
Key features:
1. Automated homology modelling
2. Template search & alignment done automatically using it's in-built database.
3. Builds a full 3D model.
4. Provides a quality score (QMEAN)_to evaluate how good your model is.......

Application:
Helps you visualize protein structures.
Useful in drug desing, structure-function studies & mutational analysis.
